editor_description = "Floor 4 (first Library floor). New: slime pads and bounce walls. A: a strong pad lifts you to a ledge two shells can't reach. B: pinball run right, pad to pad over spikes. C: shaft with bouncy walls, then back left along the top. See LEVEL_LOG.md."
